  "notes": [
    "An early native capture accidentally added a 3-second socket timeout; the original capture configuration was restored.",
    "Legacy sort tests used MongoDB 7 while expecting an option introduced in MongoDB 8; one waited indefinitely on a barrier after rejection. Preconditions and failure cleanup were corrected.",
    "An initial clean sdist invocation used mutually exclusive flags; its receipt is retained in the temporary antecedent, while its original log was overwritten. Final commands are valid and all pass.",
    "The pre-UTF8 candidate passed its complete suites, but a separate ASCII-locale probe reproduced UnicodeDecodeError. Explicit UTF-8 and a subprocess regression close this defect.",
    "ResourceWarnings in that antecedent came from raw SQLite connections in the new legacy-file test. They now use explicit closing; the strict-warning focal run passes."
  ]
